# Resource Service Context

Full context lives in `internal/resource/docs/`. Read the relevant files before making any changes:

| 文件 | 用途 |
|------|------|
| `docs/PROJECT_CONTEXT.md` | 技术栈、目录结构、关键模块、如何新增模块 |
| `docs/ARCHITECTURE_RULES.md` | 分层规则、命名约定、不可违反的硬约束 |
| `docs/HANDOFF.md` | 当前进度、待修复 Bug、下一步任务 |
